"kind":"update","title":"Update#7: Campaign & Skirmish","summary":"Greetings!I hope that after playing the demo, you now have a pretty good idea of what battles in Steel Wolverines look like. But what about the campaign? What about skirmish mode? And most importantly, when is the game coming out?Today, I’ll talk about what you can expect from the game and what will have to wait a little longer.Campaign or Skirmish: Two Ways to CommandCampaign: carry your force through the warOperation\" Przesmyk\" begins in the Baltic region in 2030. Your battlegroup, moves from ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T13:07:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039590","verified_at":"2026-10-24T14:13:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5112150-1846651706678343","game_id":"steam-5112150","kind":"update","title":"Update#6: Demo V2 is live","summary":"Greetings!The second version of the Steel Wolverines demo is now available on Steam.Demo V2 adds a second scenario, a new BMS view available when zooming out, additional units, and numerous improvements based on feedback from the first release.What’s New in Demo V2?A Second Scenario: Red DuskThe new scenario lets you command Russian VDV forces attempting to stop a Lithuanian advance.You will have to defend multiple river crossings with limited and sometimes uncertain intelligence. Additional BMD","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T16:07:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678343","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:46:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5112150-1846018067934127","game_id":"steam-5112150","kind":"update","title":"Update#5: State of the game","summary":"Greetings!What’s New Since the Demo Launch?After fixing the most frustrating issues in the Steel Wolverines demo, it’s time to build the missing mechanics and develop features that have so far been placeholders. Here are some of the changes I’ve already made:1. MANPADS, shotguns, and dronesShoulder-fired anti-aircraft missiles such as the Stinger are no longer a way to counter small FPV drones. I’ve also added shotguns that infantry can carry. They work much like active protection systems (APS) ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T17:15:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934127","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:46:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5112150-1845383656386824","game_id":"steam-5112150","kind":"update","title":"Update#4: Demo - Quality of Life Update","summary":"Hello,I’d describe the response to the demo as positive :) Many of you seem to understand that Steel Wolverines is trying to combine classic ideas from 1990s games with modern UI/UX expectations and the realities of today’s battlefield, which go far beyond the concepts associated with era of Operation Desert Storm. Keep in mind that what you're seeing is still an alpha version that contains bugs and errors/compromises in terms of realism, which should be corrected over time.Demo Quality of Life ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T15:46:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386824","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:46:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5112150-1844751498231154","game_id":"steam-5112150","kind":"update","title":"Update#3: Demo Is Now Live","summary":"Steel Wolverines Demo Is Now LiveAfter several weeks of delays, the Steel Wolverines demo is finally available on Steam.The demo includes a guided tutorial and a full scenario featuring a meeting engagement between a Polish-German NATO battlegroup and elements of a Russian mechanized formation.Demo FeaturesA step-by-step tutorial covering the fundamentals of tactical command and combined-arms combat.A large meeting-engagement scenario set near Žubriai, Lithuania.Modern tanks, infantry fighting v","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T10:45:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231154","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:46:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5112150-1844115010492114","game_id":"steam-5112150","kind":"update","title":"Update#2: Demo status","summary":"Where is the Demo?First, the good news. The demo build has been approved by Valve, so the release is now entirely in my hands.The bad news? Both the demo and the game need a better tutorial, as well as improvements to infantry detection and survivability.I still expect both issues to be addressed by the end of September.Tim Stone from Tally Ho Corner had a chance to play the Steel Wolverines demo: https://tallyhocorner.com/2026/09/steel-wolverines-gets-under-the-cope-cage-of-modern-warfare/ and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T14:01:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010492114","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:46:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5112150-1842212951303341","game_id":"steam-5112150","kind":"update","title":"Update#1: Demo status and content","summary":"Greetings!Steel Wolverines is wrapping up its 8th month of development. With Skirmish Mode working satisfactorily, the campaign improving (kind of), and the map editor functioning properly, the main focus has now shifted toward releasing the demo.First Demo Content — ETA: SeptemberThe first demo release is planned for the first two weeks of September.The demo will feature one meeting engagement scenario on a map based on Zubriai, Lithuania, playable as NATO. The main goal of this version will be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T14:05:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303341","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:46:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5112150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5112150":"2026-10-26T08:23:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5112150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:10Z"},"5237730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:10Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5112150","app_id":5112150,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:32Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"92c71863fc76c3cf09f6b63108cf89360397d0dba016126fba36fab5ea8fb303","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A turn-based tactical wargame inspired by the classics of the 1990s. Build your own battlegroup and fight on a modern battlefield where detecting the enemy, choosing the right weapon, and landing the first accurate shot decide the outcome.","publishers":[{"name":"TboneWargames"}],"developers":[{"name":"TboneWargames"}]},"release":{